{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"以H5的防备松动和H6的珍惜与时间流逝解释安静余韵中的轻微不舍，既保留了依恋的因果，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因或新增历史事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"M38提供了舍不得积累后身体先于念头产生靠近冲动的心理桥，H2与H6进一步解释冲动为何冒头又收回，而未发生的倾诉只是当下的心理意向，不是新增事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H2与H6结合M30和M31，清楚解释了在意、无法确认、注意力反复卡住到身体停住的局部心理过程，没有把感觉受阻直接归因于音乐变化，也没有改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"每条都明确写出了当下感受及其心理成因，H与M的引用也能对应具体因果，因此不依赖听感记录仍可理解这段情绪变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d1518d05-2552-41af-888a-9564ebc6ecb9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133757800456Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.813, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:39:39.621410+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "edb84f195bcb702c0670a1224dd0ba5605b1403087ae4e3dd1be8cfc53457fb4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc49587